// Halvex Runner: the style 2a reference frigate. x right, y down, forward = up (-y); rot = quarter turns
// clockwise; flip = mirror before rotating.
// Layout adjusted 11 Oct 2026 (decided by Niklas) so the ship works under the drydock rules, from the concept art
// (this blueprint is the source of truth now):
// - the wing-tip pulse lasers moved up one cell into the wing shoulders (replacing two 1×1 slopes), so nothing
//   blocks their line of fire; the silhouette changes only there;
// - all four radiators vent: two at the wing tips (each beside a fission reactor, +2 power) and two in the tail row;
// - the logic cores and the cargo bays swapped places, and the shield emitters moved one cell outwards, away from
//   the fusion reactor's heat; two gyros sit beside the fission reactors for turning.
// The beams, capacitors, fusion reactor, torch drive, thrusters and the left/right symmetry are unchanged.
(
    id: "halvex_runner",
    name: "Halvex Runner",
    summary: "A 12×7 arrowhead frigate with twin beams at the nose and a torch drive at the tail.",
    description: "Slopes form the leading and trailing edges, the [[part:fusion_reactor]] sits right behind the twin beams, pulse lasers ride on the wing shoulders and two [[part:gyro|gyros]] help it turn.",
    faction: "ship_mind",
    size: (12, 7),
    parts: [
        (part: "slope_1x2", x: 3, y: 0, flip: true, material: "composite"),
        (part: "beam_laser", x: 5, y: 0),
